  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EUPOL Afghanistan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union Police Mission for Afghanistan. The mission closed by the end of 2016, and the costs derive from the last Swedish Police Officers in place. EUPOL Afghanistan supported the establishment of a well-functioning Afghan police service that interacts adequately with the criminal justice system. The mission monitored, mentored, advised and trained at the level of senior management of the Afghan Ministry of Interior, Afghan Ministry of Justice, Afghan Attorney General&apos;s Office, in Kabul and several other regions.</narrative>
  </description>
